meta {
  name: Get all blogs
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blogs?page=1&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

query {
  page: 1
  limit: 20
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get All Blogs
  
  Retrieves a paginated list of all published blog posts, ordered by date and ID ascending.
  
  ## Endpoint
  `GET /api/v1/blogs`
  
  ## Authorization
  None — this is a public endpoint.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Param | Type   | Required | Default | Constraints         | Description                     |
  | :---- | :----- | :------- | :------ | :------------------ | :------------------------------ |
  | page  | number | No       | 1       | Integer             | The page number to retrieve.    |
  | limit | number | No       | 20      | Integer, 1–100      | Number of blog posts per page.  |
  
  ## Success Response
  - **Status Code**: `200 OK`
  - **Body**:
    ```json
    {
      "success": true,
      "message": "Blogs found successfully",
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "uuid",
          "title": "Blog Title",
          "description": "Blog description",
          "documentUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
          "publicId": "Cedarrise Initiative/BLOG/...",
          "date": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ]
    }
    ```
  
  ## Error Responses
  - **400 Bad Request**: Validation failed (e.g., `page` or `limit` is not a valid integer, `limit` exceeds 100).
  
  ## Notes
  - Results are cached under `cedarrise:blogs:list:{page}:{limit}` with a 1-hour TTL.
  - Results are ordered by `date ASC`, then `id ASC`.
}
